      "content": "<p>The covalency and oxidation state respectively of boron in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.757ex\" height=\"2.578ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -889.3 2986.7 1139.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1394,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2075.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(2386.6,477.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, are :</p>",
